<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="A2.F3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">CDF plots of mixture distributions for the Gumbel-max watermark.
Here, <math id="A2.F3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> represents the dominance parameter used in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Failure on green-red list watermarks. ‣ B.1 Further Details ‣ Appendix B Simulation Study: Details and Results ‣ Appendices ‣ Optimal Estimation of Watermark Proportions in Hybrid AI-Human Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> for generating NTP distributions, and <math id="A2.F3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\varepsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ε</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the true proportion.
</span></figcaption>
