Here <math id="A2.F5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> is the dominance parameter in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Failure on green-red list watermarks. ‣ B.1 Further Details ‣ Appendix B Simulation Study: Details and Results ‣ Appendices ‣ Optimal Estimation of Watermark Proportions in Hybrid AI-Human Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> for the NTP distributions. The best MAEs for both <span id="A2.F5.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">INI</span> <math id="A2.F5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\widehat{{\varepsilon}}_{\mathrm{ini}}}(\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mi>ini</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\widehat{{\varepsilon}}_{\mathrm{ini}}}(\delta)</annotation></semantics></math> and <span id="A2.F5.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">IND</span> <math id="A2.F5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\widehat{{\varepsilon}}_{\mathrm{rfn}}}(\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mi>rfn</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\widehat{{\varepsilon}}_{\mathrm{rfn}}}(\delta)</annotation></semantics></math>, are reported by searching <math id="A2.F5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math> over <math id="A2.F5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{10^{-1},10^{-2},10^{-3}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{10^{-1},10^{-2},10^{-3}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
